DISCLAIMER OF RESPONSIBLE USE

This software automates actions on LinkedIn and sends email on the user's
behalf. Automated connecting may conflict with LinkedIn's Terms of Service, and
unsolicited email is regulated in many jurisdictions. This project is intended
for genuine, low-volume, personal interview-preparation networking.

You are solely responsible for how you use it, for complying with the terms of
any platform you use it with, and for any consequences to your accounts. The
authors provide this tool for educational and personal use and accept no
liability for misuse. Keep volumes low, keep your messages honest, and respect
the people you contact.
